    "detailed_description": "Speedboat League is a beautiful, fast and intense boat racing game, born on the shoulders of classic arcade boat racers (Wave Race, Eliminator Boat Duel) with a mix of modern day karting games. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nRace fast and shoot 'em all up with powerful speedboats.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHighlights of the game:<br />\r\n- lots of weapons to use with in-game enhance system (it's your choice to fire it now or collect an upgrade and use more powerful weapon)<br />\r\n- tons of unlockables<br />\r\n- 8 stages with mirror variations, giving total of 16 tracks<br />\r\n- game modes like normal race, eliminator or time trial <br />\r\n- local 4-player split-screen and online multiplayer up to 8 players<br />\r\n- arcade mode for better solo experince<br />\r\n- boat customization menu - stand out in the crowd!<br />\r\n- beat your best times and show them in online leaderboards<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour speedboat season starts now!",
    "about_the_game": "Speedboat League is a beautiful, fast and intense boat racing game, born on the shoulders of classic arcade boat racers (Wave Race, Eliminator Boat Duel) with a mix of modern day karting games. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nRace fast and shoot 'em all up with powerful speedboats.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHighlights of the game:<br />\r\n- lots of weapons to use with in-game enhance system (it's your choice to fire it now or collect an upgrade and use more powerful weapon)<br />\r\n- tons of unlockables<br />\r\n- 8 stages with mirror variations, giving total of 16 tracks<br />\r\n- game modes like normal race, eliminator or time trial <br />\r\n- local 4-player split-screen and online multiplayer up to 8 players<br />\r\n- arcade mode for better solo experince<br />\r\n- boat customization menu - stand out in the crowd!<br />\r\n- beat your best times and show them in online leaderboards<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour speedboat season starts now!",
    "short_description": "Race fast and shoot 'em all up with powerful speedboats. Intense, action-packed boat racer with lots of weapons, tons of unlockables, crazy stages, game modes, local and online multiplayer. Speedboat League has it all.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
